<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hello, <o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p data-pm-slice="1 1 []">We are in the process of review your recent application to partner with National Funding and Quick Bridge.  In reviewing the file, we need the following information to complete the review:</p><p data-pm-slice="1 1 []"><br></p><p><strong>INSERT</strong></p><p><strong><br></strong></p><p>If you could please provide that information to us at your earliest convenience we would appreciate it.</p><p>We are excited about the opportunity to partner with you.   Please do not hesitate to contact us with any questions.</p><p dir="auto" style="color: rgb(47, 57, 65); font-family: arial; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent; line-height: normal; color: black; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br>Thank you,</font></span></p><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!User.Name} |&nbsp;{!User.Title}</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}</b></font></p></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div>{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</div><div>{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</div></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">P:&nbsp;{!User.Phone} | F:&nbsp;{!User.Fax}</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">E:&nbsp;{!User.Email}</font></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
